{"id": "dev-say-0024", "system": "whisper-large-v3-q8.greedy", "stage": "asr", "hyp": "あの、タイプスクリプトの型エラーが、えー、30件くらい出ています。", "latency_s": 1.1587534999707714, "details": {"logmel_s": 0.0030497919069603086, "encoder_s": 0.664296375005506, "decoder_s": 0.49137429206166416, "n_tokens": 27.0}}
